    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roam Survival</strong></h2><br><strong>Survive and Repair Your Plane on a Danger-Filled Island!</strong><br><br>In Roam Survival, your plane has crashed on a remote island full of mysteries and threats. As Sam, a plane mechanic, your mission is to survive in this hostile environment while seeking the resources needed to repair your aircraft and escape this terrifying place.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><strong>Extensive Exploration:</strong> Explore a vast open world filled with unique details, from dense jungles to ancient ruins, every corner of the island is packed with secrets and surprises.<br><br><strong>Resource Management:</strong> Collect and manage vital resources for your survival. Build shelters, craft tools, and keep your basic needs covered while facing the island's challenges.<br><br><strong>Intense Combat:</strong> Face a variety of enemies, from wild creatures to hostile tribes. Develop strategies to overcome dangers and protect yourself as you explore.<br><br><strong>Construction and Customization:</strong> Design and upgrade your shelter and gear. Use the resources you find to build structures, create useful items, and personalize your island life.<br><br><strong>Graphical and Audio Immersion:</strong> Immerse yourself in a vibrant environment with detailed graphics and an immersive soundtrack that further enhances the survival experience.<br><br>Are you ready to face the island's challenges and repair your plane? Adventure and survival await you in Roam Survival!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roam Survival</strong></h2><br><strong>Survive and Repair Your Plane on a Danger-Filled Island!</strong><br><br>In Roam Survival, your plane has crashed on a remote island full of mysteries and threats. As Sam, a plane mechanic, your mission is to survive in this hostile environment while seeking the resources needed to repair your aircraft and escape this terrifying place.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><strong>Extensive Exploration:</strong> Explore a vast open world filled with unique details, from dense jungles to ancient ruins, every corner of the island is packed with secrets and surprises.<br><br><strong>Resource Management:</strong> Collect and manage vital resources for your survival. Build shelters, craft tools, and keep your basic needs covered while facing the island's challenges.<br><br><strong>Intense Combat:</strong> Face a variety of enemies, from wild creatures to hostile tribes. Develop strategies to overcome dangers and protect yourself as you explore.<br><br><strong>Construction and Customization:</strong> Design and upgrade your shelter and gear. Use the resources you find to build structures, create useful items, and personalize your island life.<br><br><strong>Graphical and Audio Immersion:</strong> Immerse yourself in a vibrant environment with detailed graphics and an immersive soundtrack that further enhances the survival experience.<br><br>Are you ready to face the island's challenges and repair your plane? Adventure and survival await you in Roam Survival!",
    "short_description": "In Roam Survival, Sam, an inexperienced mechanic, ventures into a vast open world in search of the last missing explorer. Hunt, build shelters, and explore uncharted lands while uncovering hidden mysteries. Every step could be your last. Will you survive?",
